{{!
    @template tool_lp/competency_path

    A competency's path in its framework, as a breadcrumb, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/competency_path of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500), admin/tool/lp/templates/competency_path.mustache.
    Re-diff it against that file on every core upgrade. Core's plan page and course competencies page
    include it after a floated "Path:" label of their own, so it prints no label of its own.

    Kept from core: the nav element and its id competency-path-<uniqid>; the links to competencies.php
    under showlinks and the plain names otherwise; the names triple-stashed, as the exporter formats
    them; the JavaScript that arms tool_lp/competencydialogue.
    Changed: the trail is an ordered list (dim-comp-path), the separator is drawn by the stylesheet,
    the nav is named by the "Path:" string, and the last ancestor, the competency itself, is marked
    aria-current.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (tool_lp/competencydialogue delegates on the body)

    Context variables required for this template:
    * framework - id, name
    * ancestors - array of id, name, last
    * showlinks, pluginbaseurl, pagecontextid

    Example context (json):
    {
        "framework": {
            "id": "1",
            "name": "Professional skills"
        },
        "ancestors": [
            {
                "id": "2",
                "name": "Communication"
            },
            {
                "id": "1",
                "name": "Communicate clearly",
                "last": true
            }
        ],
        "showlinks": true,
        "pluginbaseurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp",
        "pagecontextid": 1
    }
}}
<nav id="competency-path-{{uniqid}}" class="dim-comp-path" aria-label="{{#str}}path, tool_lp{{/str}}">
    <ol class="dim-comp-path__list">
        <li class="dim-comp-path__item">
            {{#showlinks}}
            <a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/competencies.php?competencyframeworkid={{framework.id}}&amp;pagecontextid={{pagecontextid}}">{{{framework.name}}}</a>
            {{/showlinks}}
            {{^showlinks}}
            {{{framework.name}}}
            {{/showlinks}}
        </li>
        {{#ancestors}}
        <li class="dim-comp-path__item"{{#last}} aria-current="location"{{/last}}>
            {{#showlinks}}
            <a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/competencies.php?competencyid={{id}}">{{{name}}}</a>
            {{/showlinks}}
            {{^showlinks}}
            {{{name}}}
            {{/showlinks}}
        </li>
        {{/ancestors}}
    </ol>
</nav>
{{#js}}
require(['tool_lp/competencydialogue'], function(Compdialogue) {
    Compdialogue.init();
});
{{/js}}
